-- Seed the Driven supplier map into crm_vendors. NOT applied to the live project.
-- Run after 20261109190000_crm_vendors.sql. Safe to re-run: it inserts only when crm_vendors is empty.
-- Map score (column Score 0-5) is stored on crm_vendors.map_score. Scorecard rows are not seeded.
-- Sheet tabs include a header, so Category Risk has 30 data rows and Changes has 38.

